descriptions.job-172hrls:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Executive Content &amp;amp; Experiences team builds trusted relationships with leaders shaping the global economy. We design high-impact programs—including executive briefings, advisory boards, flagship convenings at Davos, and executive programming at Stripe Sessions—to bring Stripe&#39;s strategy to life. Beyond delivering premier high-touch moments, we turn leadership insights into actionable intelligence that directly informs Stripe’s narratives, product, and go-to-market direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a rock star product marketer to translate Stripe’s most complex technology and strategy into compelling, executive-ready narratives and scalable sales motions. In this role, you will lead the content strategy and enablement engine that powers our highest-stakes executive moments—from global Executive Briefing Centers (EBCs) to bespoke leadership workshops. Sitting at the intersection of Product, Sales, and Executive Engagement, you will equip Stripe leaders, account teams, and event hosts to clearly articulate Stripe as the complete financial infrastructure for the internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Thought Leadership Narratives: Craft tailored, point-of-view-driven narratives and presentations for executive-level meetings, advisory boards, and Tier-1 convenings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Executive Briefing Center Enablement: Develop and scale sales enablement frameworks, messaging toolkits, and prep materials to empower account teams to lead impactful executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Scalable Workshop Motions: Architect and scale interactive whiteboarding and workshop frameworks that simplify complex product architectures and showcase Stripe as a complete financial infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curate Executive Demo Library: Build, maintain, and package an executive-ready demo library—repurposing existing product assets into high-touch formats designed specifically for executive experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Speaker Training &amp;amp; Certification: Create and scale a formal speaker training and certification program to prepare Stripe executives and technical subject matter experts for high-profile speaking roles and EBC engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale Content via AI: Design and deploy AI agents and workflows to automate content generation, personalize executive materials, and streamline enablement at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A crisp storyteller, strategic thinker, and enablement innovator. You are a sharp, driven problem-solver with a relentless bias for action—someone who isn&#39;t afraid to get scrappy and is energized by building new capabilities for growing teams. You excel at taking deep technical complexity—like global payments infrastructure and financial software—and turning it into elegant, high-impact stories for C-suite audiences. You understand how executive sales motions work and know how to build repeatable systems, scalable tools, and AI-driven workflows that elevate an entire organization’s narrative capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product marketing, solutions marketing, or executive enablement experience in B2B tech, SaaS, or fintech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building executive-level narratives and high-touch customer workshop motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and executing sales enablement programs, speaker training, or certification frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and visual communication skills, with extensive experience presenting to and prepping C-suite leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success working cross-functionally across Product, Sales, and Field Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1s2ffy8:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;D1VkdwWqDoLsRQx1ZvauUHzBsrf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusnzAcinQzgHdniri7xyLzSg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusnzAcinQzgHdniri7xyLzSg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusnzAcinQzgHdniri7xyLzSg&quot;&gt;The Senior Compliance Specialist assists the Compliance Manager in monitoring Turkish regulatory requirements, conducting reviews, and ensuring adherence to internal policies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBqU2AD7ILjxkKmHmU2VGGc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBqU2AD7ILjxkKmHmU2VGGc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusjgwIhBYxpGT14ZlWJiHgrd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct ongoing AML scenario reviews and sanctions-related checks in line with regulatory requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusD1fKyddwT6fsVSzs2vbnuo&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Obtain, manage, and maintain access/permissions for compliance data sources and reporting tools&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuseEb8p0XFnF4aFTJZMLfvyf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Generate and maintain compliance reports and data sets required by the compliance team and regulators&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUyFT62L3pwdLLvQYIwj1De&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitor Turkish regulatory updates and assess compliance impact on existing workflows&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusEnA8as1sXQZyf9CFcJJ0Bb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support internal and external audits with data, documentation, and analysis&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscU497SmYb3uFIAZKtFIwif&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain compliance registers, records, and case files&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus23lHTnXxFYmpsAqNpirazb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with the Compliance Manager on regulatory filings and ad hoc reviews&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuscUlI0jKVw5z49g89Wmjlvb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusvjF1h3PwOdjAG5prWBvhYe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;1–3 years of experience in compliance, ideally in fintech, financial services, or crypto.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuskvRey4ynEWkdC4SAOOATjd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong attention to detail and data analysis skills - proficiency in Excel, SQL, or compliance/AML tooling (e.g., Chainalysis, Elliptic, or similar)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusBgdoPfawh4V7mtTnXF91EG&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to interpret and apply Turkish regulatory guidance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusF3hsw3qHuTmLdDqfz8g0ie&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong written and verbal communication (Turkish and English).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0trzzeo:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is the company bringing global finance onchain. Backed by over $1 billion in capital, we are the premier digital asset infrastructure provider trusted by thousands of industry-defining financial institutions, including banks, payment providers, fintechs, and global corporates such as BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Western Union, Stripe, and Revolut. Built for institutional scale and security, our enterprise-grade platform and network have powered over $14 trillion in digital asset transfers worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fireblocks is looking for a talented Senior Marketing Manager, North America to manage integrated marketing strategies across events, content marketing, social media, and paid digital campaigns within the region. Your main duties include strategy, execution, and analysis of marketing campaigns and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with the regional sales team to understand region-specific market priorities and develop impactful brand activations that deliver engaging content through story-telling and creative experiences for our customers and prospects to raise awareness and generate new business opportunities in the United States and Canada regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in partnership with the demand gen. and sales teams to build and drive region and culture-specific marketing activities that impact Fireblocks rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate regional planning and execution with sales &amp;amp; marketing stakeholders to build event calendars to increase awareness, drive engagement, generate leads, and support conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think creatively about the client and prospect experience at events, and build experiences that create unique, memorable, branded experiences for attendees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and manage communication strategies across social media, press, and digital channels leading up to, during, and after events, using them as broader branding opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of event coordination including: strategy, event messaging/marketing, signage, giveaways, contract negotiation, vendor relations, site selection, registration, agenda scheduling, staffing, on-site production and F&amp;amp;B, logistics, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct post-event evaluations and ROI analysis; report and share results and recommendations with sales team and marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategise, order, deliver, and manage inventory of swag to support sales &amp;amp; events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research industry event opportunities and evaluate sponsorship based on Fireblocks’ objectives and target audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain event documents - budgets, calendars, project plans, checklists, run-of-shows, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive ROI by working with the sales and demand generation teams to nurture leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and manage multiple projects simultaneously while meeting deadlines and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B working experience in event planning, field marketing, and/or marketing space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI tools and agents, including Claude and Gemini&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with marketing and sales tools like Hubspot, Salesforce, and Cvent (or similar webinar platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the financial services industry preferred, with added knowledge in crypto, digital assets, and tech a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing events and marketing campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and deliver cohesive event strategies, including messaging, audience, execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and in a group setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a dynamic and fast-paced environment; ability to multitask and effectively manage time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acute attention to detail; demonstrated ability for accuracy and thoroughness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with internal and external clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven negotiation, problem-solving, organisation, and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling large budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Microsoft Office (PowerPoint, Excel, Word)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. A reasonable base salary range estimate for this position is $123,000 to $162,000. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of you deciding to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-0fo91z4:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;As part of the Bybit Card Product team, you will play a pivotal role in shaping the strategy, roadmap, and execution of one of Bybit’s core products—the Bybit Card. In this role, you will define and build scalable payment experiences, bridging traditional financial infrastructure with cryptocurrency. While your primary focus will be on end-to-end product development and user journey optimization, you will also closely collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive acquisition, conversion, and retention. You will manage a team of up to 5 people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the global card product vision, strategy, and roadmap, aligning with broader company objectives and user growth goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;Define market-specific requirements and prioritize features that elevate the Bybit Card experience across multiple regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-End Feature &amp;amp; Flow Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Design, build, and optimize core card product flows, including application onboarding, KYC/compliance checks, digital/physical card issuance, wallet linking, and transaction experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;Drive the user experience around rewards, cashbacks, VIP tiers, and card management features to maximize user activation and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Market Launches &amp;amp; Localization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead go-to-market (GTM) execution for new market expansions and product features, orchestrating internal testing, alpha/beta phases, and full commercial rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Partner with local compliance, legal, and risk teams to ensure card features adhere to regional financial regulations and card network rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Vendor Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with external partners—including card schemes (Visa/Mastercard), BIN sponsors, processors, and banking partners—to build and expand technical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Define requirements for platform API integrations, ledger systems, and processor hooks to support real-time settlement and authorization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Optimization &amp;amp; Conversion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,0,0&quot;&gt;Define key product metrics (e.g., application conversion, active card usage, transaction volume, churn rate) and continuously optimize the user journey using product analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;Conduct user research and competitive benchmarking to identify growth opportunities and feature gaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Operational Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;Work closely with Card Operations, Engineering, Design, Customer Support, Risk, and Marketing to ensure seamless feature delivery and post-launch support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;Serve as the core product owner translating complex financial and operational realities into intuitive, user-centric product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;3–5+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of product management experience in fintech, card issuing, crypto, or digital payments platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of card management systems (CMS), payment processor integrations, and card network rules/ecosystems (Visa, Mastercard, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven track record of taking complex fintech or payment products from concept to launch across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong user experience (UX) mindset with an ability to simplify complex crypto and fiat payment interactions into intuitive user flows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,4,0&quot;&gt;High autonomy and creative problem-solving skills; ability to make strategic decisions independently without requiring detailed top-down guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,5,0&quot;&gt;Professional fluency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken) is required. Proficiency in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;81&quot;&gt;Mandarin Chinese&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,6,0&quot;&gt;Excellent cross-functional leadership and stakeholder management skills, with a track record of driving results across matrixed, multi-cultural teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19,7,0&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills, comfortable using data to validate hypotheses, define success metrics, and optimize transaction funnels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-03gt3i8:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is a global crypto and Web3 platform founded by Cameron and Tyler Winklevoss in 2014, offering a wide range of simple, reliable, and secure crypto products and services to individuals and institutions in over 70 countries. Our mission is to unlock the next era of financial, creative, and personal freedom by providing trusted access to the decentralized future. We envision a world where crypto reshapes the global financial system, internet, and money to create greater choice, independence, and opportunity for all — bridging traditional finance with the emerging cryptoeconomy in a way that is more open, fair, and secure. As a publicly traded company, Gemini is poised to accelerate this vision with greater scale, reach, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Enterprise Risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk at Gemini is a team dedicated to managing the next generation of financial and non-financial risks in a complex and evolving landscape. We are a diverse group of technology, legal, and operational professionals who develop new approaches to solving classic problems using cutting edge tools and processes in an ever changing industry. We are looking for like-minded individuals who are willing to be bold, visionaries and live the ethos of turning risk into return for our shareholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Risk Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is seeking an Sr. Associate, Risk Analytics to join the Risk Management function. As we evolve our risk infrastructure, we are looking for a quantitative and technically proficient individual to move our risk management from reactive, manual processes to a proactive, automated, and agentic model. This role will own the design and implementation of systems for continuous control monitoring, using agentic AI to detect, escalate, and remediate risk across the entire enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Engineering, Data, Compliance, and Operations to build the &quot;risk brain&quot; of the company—an environment where risk controls are codified, monitored in real-time, and scaled through autonomous agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Control Monitoring
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of an automated, continuous monitoring framework that spans all enterprise risk domains (Credit, Fraud, Operational, Compliance). Move the firm away from periodic/manual checks toward real-time observability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic Risk Infrastructure&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale our risk management capabilities by developing and deploying AI agents to monitor control activities. Orchestrate agentic workflows to perform proactive anomaly detection, perform root-cause analysis on incidents, and suggest risk mitigation actions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Risk Analytics&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret large, complex datasets to formulate problem statements and generate insights across all business verticals. Develop predictive models and detection tools that reduce risk exposure and enhance operational efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Governance &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a comprehensive view of the AI and model risk inventory. Develop automated dashboards that provide senior management with a &quot;solid analytical story,&quot; leveraging BI tools to track Key Risk Indicators (KRIs) against appetite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Risk Engineering, Identity, and Product teams to ensure risk telemetry is properly instrumented. Provide clear communication and training on how to interpret agentic outputs and maintain human-in-the-loop oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative field (e.g., Computer Science, Statistics, Finance, Engineering).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in risk management, analytics, or a related technical domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Proficiency: Strong SQL and relational database skills; intermediate-to-advanced Python ability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/Agentic Frameworks: Demonstrated experience or strong familiarity with building or deploying AI agents (e.g., LangChain, AutoGen, or similar orchestration frameworks) and large language model integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Monitoring: Experience designing or maintaining automated systems for data quality, observability, or control monitoring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Communication: Ability to translate complex data and AI output into clear, actionable reporting for senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindset: A &quot;no-task-is-too-small&quot; attitude, combined with the ability to operate in ambiguity and a healthy balance of empathy and skepticism toward automated systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Business Intelligence and Data Visualization (Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in model risk management (MRM) and knowledge of MAS AI MRM supervisory expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS Bedrock, GCP and opensource LLMS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in MLOps or AIOps (e.g., CI/CD pipelines for AI/ML models).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;It Pays to Work Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The compensation &amp;amp; benefits package for this role includes:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive starting pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A discretionary annual bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Long-term incentive in the form of a new hire equity grant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;401K with company matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is between $99,400 - $142,000 in the State of New York. This range is not inclusive of our discretionary bonus or equity package. When determining a candidate’s compensation, we consider a number of factors including skillset, experience, job scope, and current market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the United States, we offer a hybrid work approach at our hub offices, balancing the benefits of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Expectations may vary by location and role, so candidates are encouraged to connect with their recruiter to learn more about the specific policy for the role. Employees who do not live near one of our hubs are part of our remote workforce. All employees, however, are required to onboard in-person at one of our office locations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Gemini, we strive to build diverse teams that reflect the people we want to empower through our products, and we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, or Veteran status. Equal Opportunity is the Law, and Gemini is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. If you have a specific need that requires accommodation, please let a member of the People Team know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;@LI-MW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-0m382gw:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s Professional Services Sales team works with our most strategic users; You will help customers accelerate their growth and adoption on Stripe. This role is responsible for leading strategic conversations during pre-sales that will transform the payments and financial infrastructure for leading enterprises, ultimately driving revenue growth through our professional service offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Services Seller, you will sell large Professional Services engagements to strategic clients and drive Stripe’s future growth engine by building relationships with prospective users and turning them into happy Stripe users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the entire Professional Services sales cycle for enterprise companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives on named account lists to develop account plans aimed at winning and expanding Professional Services business with enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the success of Professional Services by managing and forecasting bookings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft custom proposals that align with clients&#39; business outcomes, utilizing services across Professional Services and partner offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior leadership in customer organizations on building business cases for digital transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead pre-sales workshops with customers, focusing on strategy, vision, discovery, and assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape Professional Services deals, and build and negotiate contracts/Statements of Work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with Product and Engineering teams to influence product strategy for large clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with GTM partners to integrate complementary strategies and drive mutual growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the delivery team with user insights to ensure that the delivery aligns with the desired business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional services sales experience, preferably at a technology company or a consulting firm, with a track record of top performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in pre-sales and sales of sizable service engagements, as well as in contract and Statement of Work (SOW) development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead large transformational engagements using disruptive technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives on the urgency and importance of working with our largest customers, achieving set objectives while balancing competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex business requirements and develop tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate ambiguity to produce strategic insights and identify opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in Mandarin Chinese and English is required for this role, as it involves working primarily with clients within the Greater China region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the sales cycles associated with a SaaS product or technology platform for strategic enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An in-depth understanding of the buyer journey and the ability to lead complex, multi-party sales in a highly consultative manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with upper middle market and enterprise companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of driving cross-functional alignment among a broad set of stakeholders, including engineering, sales, support, product, marketing, data science, and senior leadership, to achieve growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and scaling a go-to-market (GTM) growth discipline, including the development of strategy, processes, and operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create a strong growth culture within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a growth-stage internet/software company and/or the payments industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs and their role in digital solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0jlo69s:
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussQumjJyp0pDHcFh7Y3bH0b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OvVyd3xPZo5hNhxbppju7P8isgg&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CzjQdI1IWofbWMxmIahu6dAMsjc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Q5McdBHqRos9a1xglGGuWZx7sgc&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusdoP7NU01oX9Z29HojysCiF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Software Engineer or Senior Software Engineer to join the OEX Mobile Growth team in Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The team operates at the intersection of mobile engineering, consumer growth, and product development. You will work closely with Product, Business Development, and regional market teams to build and improve growth initiatives that directly influence user acquisition, activation, conversion, and retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is suited to an engineer who enjoys solving user-facing problems, working with data, and contributing ideas beyond implementation. You will have the opportunity to take ownership of projects from problem definition through launch, measurement, and iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;R1MMdOP7Jor8rJxZjvEuEmM9s6b&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, and maintain reliable mobile growth features and supporting systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute across the full engineering lifecycle, from understanding business and user problems to implementation, launch, monitoring, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and optimise growth capabilities such as onboarding funnels, referral programmes, acquisition journeys, engagement mechanics, notifications, and experimentation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Managers, Business Development, data teams, and regional stakeholders to translate growth objectives into practical engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument user journeys and analyse relevant metrics to identify friction points and improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical discussions, evaluate trade-offs, and contribute proposals based on engineering principles, user impact, and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools to improve productivity, code quality, testing, and problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code while contributing to code reviews and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For senior-level hires, independently lead projects, guide technical decisions, and support the development of other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJHbXag5ngXLLiXggj1zhBg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;R1MMdOP7Jor8rJxZjvEuEmM9s6b&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of software engineering experience, with greater depth and independent project ownership expected at the Senior Software Engineer level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience developing production mobile applications using iOS technologies such as Swift or Objective-C, or Android technologies such as Kotlin or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including data structures, algorithms, system design, testing, debugging, and performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building consumer-facing products, with an understanding of how engineering decisions affect user experience and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and data instincts: you are comfortable thinking in terms of user journeys, funnels, conversion, retention, and measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take ownership of engineering tasks and work effectively with product and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and solution-oriented mindset: you identify problems, form a point of view, and propose practical ways forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI coding tools as part of your development workflow, together with the judgment to review, test, and validate AI-generated outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills in a fast-moving, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusKUjfoqh7QZ5RVAXhjX7gig&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Mobile development experience in iOS (Swift/Objective-C) or Android (Kotlin/Java) — or backend experience building growth systems that serve mobile apps directly (e.g. growth APIs, attribution pipelines, notification infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Depth in mobile attribution and MMPs (AppsFlyer, Adjust, SKAdNetwork).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;ASO operational experience (App Store Connect, Google Play Console).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience building referral systems, k-factor mechanics, or anti-fraud layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in fintech, crypto, or regulated consumer financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience operating across US, EEA, and APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A/B experiment framework ownership at meaningful scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Avh0dL0UvoHyoFxymwmuPqtAsWe&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusxvzyTH4iZpRPTygm6sKzcf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus9Bu8Z2VOqDK5F51723OA8g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusB7tdGuv2SmCPjgmCN3Jb1c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and Education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusZTvzFyB7VKd89mBtiKL9ob&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus4VLa66AV1kBqr1XQp7CFec&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wellness and meal allowances&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusktLuOm7fBzEDlSg6b719qf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comprehensive healthcare schemes for employees and dependants&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusXaQ6LYBcrJKsuq40ykOyNr&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
